2a:["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted","children":"Bad motion is decoration. Good motion is communication — it explains what changed, what to look at and what just happened. The difference is a system, not taste."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-12 mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl","children":"Motion is part of the design token set"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted","children":"The same way you define colors and spacing, define motion: durations, easings, and spring physics as named tokens. When a developer reaches for \"enter\" or \"fade\" instead of inventing a new curve, interfaces stay consistent by construction."}],"\n",["$","pre",null,{"className":"my-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-line-strong bg-surface p-5 text-sm text-ink","children":["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded-md border border-line bg-surface-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-primary-200 [.pre_&]:border-0 [.pre_&]:bg-transparent [.pre_&]:p-0 [.pre_&]:text-inherit","children":"enter: spring, stiffness 260, damping 24\nemphasis: spring, stiffness 380, damping 18\nmuted: ease [0.4, 0, 0.2, 1], 240ms\n"}]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-12 mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl","children":"Springs beat tweens for interface elements"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted","children":"Physical springs feel natural because they're physical — they settle with momentum instead of stopping dead. Framer Motion makes springs first-class. Reserve timed tweens for large-scale, choreographed sequences."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-12 mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl","children":"Respect reduced motion like a P0 bug"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted","children":["Every animation ships with a fallback for ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded-md border border-line bg-surface-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-primary-200 [.pre_&]:border-0 [.pre_&]:bg-transparent [.pre_&]:p-0 [.pre_&]:text-inherit","children":"prefers-reduced-motion"}],". Not as a feature to add later — as part of the token. If you can't express your UI without motion, your UI has a deeper problem."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-12 mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl","children":"Motion should answer \"what just happened?\""}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted","children":["Animations are spatial: something entered, exited, reordered or changed state. Animate the layer that changed, keep the rest calm, and always move the attention to the outcome. Layout animations with ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded-md border border-line bg-surface-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-primary-200 [.pre_&]:border-0 [.pre_&]:bg-transparent [.pre_&]:p-0 [.pre_&]:text-inherit","children":"layoutId"}]," are the single highest-leverage trick in modern UI motion — shared elements fly between states instead of re-rendering abruptly."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-12 mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl","children":"Keep the budget"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted","children":["Motion is a performance line item, not an extra. Springs and transforms run on the compositor; animating ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded-md border border-line bg-surface-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-primary-200 [.pre_&]:border-0 [.pre_&]:bg-transparent [.pre_&]:p-0 [.pre_&]:text-inherit","children":"height"}]," and ","$L2d"," does not. We measure before and after and keep the animation budget inside the Lighthouse target like everything else."]}],"\n","$L2e"]}]
